From 7f2bb25e4dc4eb8a9b4928e5ab0a503dfb1686dd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ChopGimp <mathieu.redon@proton.me>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 17:16:51 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 110/116] =?UTF-8?q?ChopGimp:=20stable=20XCF=20effects=20ca?=
 =?UTF-8?q?che=20key,=20=C2=AB=20Aide=20=C2=BB=20button,=20units=20of=20te?=
 =?UTF-8?q?xt=20spacing?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- fx cache: the key no longer includes the ELF build-ids of ChopGimp and
  GEGL/babl (every rebuild invalidated all stored caches). It now uses
  CHOPGIMP_FX_RENDER_VERSION (app/core/chopgimp-fx-render-version.h, to
  bump manually when effect rendering changes — list in the header) plus
  the GIMP, GEGL and babl versions. Caches written with the former key
  are ignored.
- po-libgimp/fr.po: "_Help" of GimpDialog (« Aid_e ») and the profile
  labels of the color selectors were missing from the catalogue.
- options bar: letter spacing shown in px (Pango device units), line
  spacing in the text unit (follows font-size-unit); warp hardness,
  strength and spacing in %.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
